AI-Powered Workplace Productivity Assistant
A practical, ethical AI assistant that automates 5 core workplace tasks:

Email Generation - Professional emails from bullet points
Meeting Summarization - Summaries, action items, decisions from transcripts
Task Planning - Breaks goals into prioritized tasks with timelines
Research Assistance - Structured research briefs with sources framework
Chatbot Interaction - Context-aware workplace Q&A chatbot
Built with Python, Streamlit, and prompt engineering best practices.

🚀 Live Demo Features
This repo includes a fully functional Streamlit app (app.py) that you can run locally or deploy to Streamlit Cloud.

🛠️ Tech Stack
Frontend: Streamlit
AI Models: OpenAI GPT-4o / Gemini / Any LLM via API (prompt-engineered, model-agnostic)
Prompt Engineering Techniques Used: Role prompting, Few-shot, Chain-of-Thought, Structured Output, Constraints
