⚙️ Getting Started
1. Create GitHub Repo
Go to github.com -> New Repository
Name: AI-Productivity-Assistant
Public, Add README unchecked (we have one)
Create and upload these files.
2. Run Locally
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
3. Set your API Key (Optional for demo)
The app works in DEMO mode without an API key using templated logic. To use real LLMs:
Set env variable: OPENAI_API_KEY or add to Streamlit secrets.

